  "description": "Convert string to zigzag pattern across numRows and read line by line.",
  "target": "PAHNAPLSIIGYIR",
  "pseudocode": "1. if numRows == 1 return s\n2. rows = [\"\" for _ in range(numRows)]\n3. currRow = 0, step = 1\n4. for char in s:\n5.   rows[currRow] += char\n6.   if currRow == 0 or currRow == numRows - 1: step = -step\n7.   currRow += step\n8. return ''.join(rows)",
